{
  "bodyHash": "poiA+C8QUX4=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">樹木收割機是一個可設定的模組，讓你能通過砍伐一棵樹的基底方塊來瞬間收割樹木、扭曲樹木和巨型蘑菇。這可以是樹的任何部分。樹苗會自動被替換，使用樹木掉落物。模組中有許多檢查機制，從防止意外砍伐用原木建造的房屋，到決定哪些樹葉應該消失。<br><br>預設情況下，收割僅在按下蹲下按鈕時有效，但可在設定中切換。更多功能範例請見下方。有許多設定選項可讓你按照喜好調整模組。<br><br>開發為與我的<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">礦石收割機</a>模組搭配使用。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設設定下的功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>所有樹木，無論是原版還是模組新增的，都可通過蹲下並砍伐一個方塊快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>砍伐一棵樹所需的時間取決於其中的原木數量。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>收割樹木後，樹葉會非常快速地消失。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>樹苗會在所有樹葉消失後被替換。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>地獄中的扭曲樹木可快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>巨型蘑菇也可快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>可通過黑名單排除特定斧頭類型收割樹木。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>許多檢查機制來判斷是否為樹木。不會意外破壞房屋。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>當兩種樹木相鄰時，只有被破壞樹木的樹葉會消失。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>與其他模組相容。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，樹木收割僅在玩家主手持有斧頭時生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，樹木收割在不按下蹲下按鈕時生效。若停用則相反，僅在蹲下時生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否讓模組嘗試找到樹木最底部的原木並從那裡開始。這意味著你可以從中間破壞樹木，它仍然會完全被砍倒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，被破壞樹木周圍的樹葉會快速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，地獄中的扭曲菌柄/緋紅樹木也會快速被砍倒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，巨型/大型蘑菇也會快速被砍倒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，帶有玩家放置的樹葉的樹木不會被破壞。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，收割樹木時會自動從掉落物中替換樹苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，當收割巨型蘑菇且 'enableHugeMushrooms' 啟用時，會自動從掉落物中替換蘑菇。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，每收割一個原木，所持斧頭會損失耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.0，最小 0.001，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在這裡設定砍倒一棵樹會消耗斧頭多少耐久度。例如，設為 0.1 時，每 10 個原木消耗 1 點耐久度。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家每收割一個原木，疲勞度增加 0.005（Minecraft 預設每破壞一個方塊）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.0，最小 0.001，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此設定決定每收割一個原木應為玩家增加多少疲勞度。預設為 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，收割時間會根據樹木中現有原木數量增加。數量由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier' 決定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.1，最小 0.01，最大 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在啟用 'increaseHarvestingTimePerLog' 時，收割一棵樹需要多長時間。實際速度為：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 3，最小 1，最大 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">設定收割樹木後每 tick 應破壞多少樹葉。增加此值會加速樹葉快速消失，但每 tick 消耗更多處理能力。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧頭黑名單功能：</strong></span><br>可以只允許特定斧頭收割樹木。首次載入模組時會生成一個黑名單檔案。其位置為 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。這也適用於模組新增的斧頭物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>收割一棵白樺樹，旁邊有一棵橡樹。只有白樺樹的樹葉在消失：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵大橡樹：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 雲杉樹。破壞這棵樹所需的時間更長，所有 4 棵樹苗都正確替換：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於扭曲（地獄）樹木：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也適用於巨型蘑菇，這裡是棕色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及紅色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概述和更多資訊。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
